<title>MOROCCO: Morocco launches census of agriculture.</title>
<headline>Morocco launches census of agriculture.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco is launching a census of its agriculture sector in order to define a long-term strategy to develop the industry, a spokesman at the agriculture ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;With the new economic changes on the world market...It became urgent to make a census of the agriculture sector and help define a long-term strategy in order to upgrade its vital activity,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The exercise, organised with the U.N. Food and Agriculture Organisation, will continue over a six-month period.</p>
<p>--Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
